Fixed N+1 queries when Device tables render outside their primary list views (e.g. on Controller Managed Device Group and Device Type detail pages) — the `primary_ip` property chooses between two foreign keys, invisible to the automatic accessor-based optimization; the table now prefetches both when the column is visible. (The Module/ModuleType `display` reads are covered by their `display_prefetch_related` declarations.) Controller Managed Device Group detail: 152 → 53 queries; Device Type detail: 180 → 81.
